Text: 4 Conclusion In this paper, we reviewed some challenges that we believe are central to the work in clinical NLP. Difﬁcult access to data due to privacy concerns has been an obstacle to progress in the ﬁeld. We have discussed how the protection of privacy through sanitization measures and the requirement for in- formed consent may affect the work in this do- main.

