Text: Related to difﬁcult access to raw clinical data is the lack of available annotated datasets for model training and benchmarking. The reality is that annotation projects do take place, but are typically constrained to a single healthcare or- ganization. Therefore, much of the effort put into annotation is lost afterwards due to impos- sibility of sharing with the larger research com- munity (Chapman et al., 2011; Fan et al., 2011).

